Package: qore-kalman-module
Architecture: any
Depends: ${qore:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-kalman-module-doc
Description: Kalman filters and matrix operations for Qore
 This module provides immutable dense matrices, linear and extended Kalman
 filters, batch processing and ready-to-use tracking model factories.
 Compiler metadata is included for Qore's tools. Eigen template code is
 compiled into the module; no separate Eigen runtime library is needed.

Package: qore-kalman-module-doc
Section: doc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Build-Profiles: <!nodoc>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-kalman-module
Description: documentation and examples for Qore's kalman module
 This package contains the HTML API reference and example tests for Qore's
 Kalman filtering module.
